-- src:3201 | SCHEDULE I (Subsection 12(2))
-- src:3202 | Table of Weeks of Benefits
@ref Employment Insurance Act Schedule I (src:3201-3202)
GIVEN hours IS A NUMBER
      rate IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `Act Schedule I the maximum number of weeks of benefits` IS
    CONSIDER `Act Schedule I the row for the hours of insurable employment` hours
    WHEN NOTHING   THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST row  THEN `ei6 the cell of the row in the column of` row (`the band of the regional rate of unemployment` rate)

